OpenAI source material

This forest adapts and expands the exposition of:
  OpenAI, The crossing number of complete bipartite graphs,
  23 September 2026, and its accompanying Lean development.
  https://github.com/openai/math
  Commit: fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb

OpenAI distributes this material under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The archived subset in source-material/openai-math preserves the upstream
files unchanged, including its LICENSE. The snapshot description and
source-material/manifest.json identify the archived files and their hashes.

The forest's native notes reorganize and rewrite the exposition, separate
and tag definitions and results, expand proof steps, link the paper to Lean
declarations, and add examples and editorial discussions. Each note records
its provenance; source-map.json and lean-map.json give further source
locations. These changes belong to this reading project.

